       aahh, eesspp, ppiimm, ssccttpp, ttccpp, uuddpp
              Abbreviations for:
                   pprroottoo \\_p_r_o_t_o_c_o_l
              where _p_r_o_t_o_c_o_l is one of the above protocols.

